>Ring</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sagredos</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Melissopoulou</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsigilis</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Nikolaidis</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of supplementation with conjugated linoleic acid on human serum lipids and body fat</article-title><source>J Nutr Biochem</source><year>2001</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>585</fpage><lpage>594</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12031264</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sagredos</surname><given-names>AN</given-names></name><name><surname>Von Leitner</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Zusammenh&#x000e4;nge zwischen der Erythrozyten- und Serum-Fetts&#x000e4;uren-zusammensetzung und dem Gehalt an Selen und Vitamin E von Hypertonikern und Normotonikern</article-title><source>Fette Seifen Anstrichm</source><year>1986</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>569</fpage><lpage>574</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zlatanos</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Laskaridis</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Feist</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Sagredos</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>CLA content and fatty acid composition of Greek feta and hard cheeses</article-title><source>Food Chem</source><year>2002</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>471</fpage><lpage>477</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Riemersma</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The demise of n-6 to n-3 fatty acid ratio? A dossier</article-title><source>Eur J Lipid Sci Technol</source><year>2001</year><volume>103</volume><fpage>372</fpage><lpage>373</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>